# tweet-hunt product rules

- The app is called tweet-hunt.
- Build a single-player retro arcade experience.
- Game A uses one tweet bird at a time.
- Game B uses two tweet birds at a time.
- Game C uses clay tweets only and is non-destructive.
- A hit immediately deletes it.
- A miss lets the tweet escape.
- The full deletion decision happens after the round.
- Do not turn the product into a dashboard.
